  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>除了矢量轮廓，Manim 还提供一套基于<strong>离散点集</strong>的 mobject：<code>Dot</code> 是日常的实心圆点，<code>Point</code> 是逻辑单点，<code>PointCloudDot</code> 则用成百上千个小点拼出圆盘。点云家族的基类 <code>PMobject</code> 与矢量家族 <code>VMobject</code> 是<strong>并列</strong>关系，能力差异很大。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "Dot",
      "text": "Dot"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p><code>Dot</code> 是一个半径很小的实心圆（<code>Circle</code> 的子类），默认无描边、完全填充，是标记位置、画散点图的第一选择。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "inheritance",
      "chain": [
        "Dot",
        "Circle",
        "Arc",
        "TipableVMobject",
        "VMobject",
        "Mobject",
        "object"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<pre><code class=\"language-python\">Dot(\n    point: Point3DLike = ORIGIN,\n    radius: float = 0.08,\n    stroke_width: float = 0,\n    fill_opacity: float = 1.0,\n    color: ParsableManimColor = WHITE,\n    **kwargs,\n)\n</code></pre>"
    },
    {
      "type": "params",
      "rows": [
        {
          "name": "<code>point</code>",
          "type": "Point3DLike",
          "default": "ORIGIN",
          "desc": "圆点中心位置"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>radius</code>",
          "type": "float",
          "default": "0.08",
          "desc": "半径；比 <code>Circle</code> 默认小得多"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>stroke_width</code>",
          "type": "float",
          "default": "0",
          "desc": "描边宽度，默认无描边"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>fill_opacity</code>",
          "type": "float",
          "default": "1.0",
          "desc": "填充不透明度，默认实心"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>color</code>",
          "type": "ParsableManimColor",
          "default": "WHITE",
          "desc": "颜色"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>kwargs</code>",
          "type": "—",
          "default": "—",
          "desc": "转发给 <code>Circle</code>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>与 <code>LabeledDot</code> 的对比：</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "compare",
      "headers": [
        "维度",
        "Dot",
        "LabeledDot"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "参数",
          "<code>point</code> / <code>radius</code> / <code>stroke_width</code> / <code>fill_opacity</code> / <code>color</code>",
          "<code>label</code>、<code>radius=None</code>、<code>buff=0.1</code>"
        ],
        [
          "标签",
          "无",
          "圆心处渲染一段文字"
        ],
        [
          "<code>radius=None</code> 时",
          "—",
          "按标签大小加 <code>buff</code> 自动计算"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "demo",
      "example": "ch02/dots_demo",
      "scene": "DotsDemo",
      "caption": "<p>红色的普通 <code>Dot</code> 与蓝色的 <code>LabeledDot(Text(\"A\"))</code>；后者圆点尺寸随标签自动适配。</p>",
      "code": "from manim import *\n\n\nclass DotsDemo(Scene):\n    def construct(self):\n        dot = Dot(LEFT * 2, color=RED)\n        label_dot = LabeledDot(Text(\"A\"), color=BLUE)\n        label_dot.next_to(dot, RIGHT, buff=1.2)\n        self.play(FadeIn(dot), FadeIn(label_dot))\n        self.play(dot.animate.move_to(ORIGIN))\n        self.wait(0.5)\n",
      "video": null
    },
    {
      "type": "notice",
      "level": "warning",
      "title": "常见错误",
      "html": "<p><code>Dot(RED)</code> 把 <code>RED</code> 当成了<strong>位置</strong>参数（第一个参数是 <code>point</code>）——正确写法是 <code>Dot(color=RED)</code> 或 <code>Dot().set_color(RED)</code>。同理 <code>Dot(LEFT * 2)</code> 是把点放到左侧 2 个单位。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "LabeledDot",
      "text": "LabeledDot"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p><code>LabeledDot</code> 是带居中标签的 <code>Dot</code>：<code>label</code> 传字符串时按 <code>MathTex</code> 渲染（<strong>需要本机 LaTeX</strong>），也可以直接传入 <code>Text</code> / <code>Tex</code> 实例；不传 <code>radius</code> 时圆点半径由标签尺寸加 <code>buff</code> 推出。参数表与示例见上方 <code>Dot</code> 一节的对比与演示。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "inheritance",
      "chain": [
        "LabeledDot",
        "Dot",
        "Circle",
        "Arc",
        "TipableVMobject",
        "VMobject",
        "Mobject",
        "object"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "notice",
      "level": "warning",
      "title": "常见错误",
      "html": "<p>无 LaTeX 环境下 <code>LabeledDot(\"A\")</code> 会直接报错。改用 pango 文本：<code>LabeledDot(Text(\"A\"))</code>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "Point",
      "text": "Point"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p><code>Point</code> 是表示<strong>单个位置</strong>的 mobject：数据上只有一个坐标点，渲染时显示为极小的方块，默认黑色、几乎不可见。它适合做纯逻辑锚点（记录位置但不希望干扰画面）。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "inheritance",
      "chain": [
        "Point",
        "PMobject",
        "Mobject",
        "object"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<pre><code class=\"language-python\">Point(location: Point3DLike = ORIGIN, color: ManimColor = BLACK, **kwargs)\n</code></pre>"
    },
    {
      "type": "params",
      "rows": [
        {
          "name": "<code>location</code>",
          "type": "Point3DLike",
          "default": "ORIGIN",
          "desc": "点的位置"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>color</code>",
          "type": "ManimColor",
          "default": "BLACK",
          "desc": "颜色，默认黑色"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>kwargs</code>",
          "type": "—",
          "default": "—",
          "desc": "转发给 <code>PMobject</code>，如 <code>stroke_width</code>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "notice",
      "level": "warning",
      "title": "常见错误",
      "html": "<p>两点需要留意：其一，<code>Point</code> 默认<strong>黑色</strong>，在黑背景上完全看不见，这不是 bug；其二，<code>Point</code> 继承自 <code>PMobject</code> 而非 <code>VMobject</code>，<strong>没有</strong> <code>set_fill</code> / <code>set_stroke</code> / <code>set_opacity</code> 方法，调了要么报错要么落入 <code>Mobject</code> 的 <code>set_*</code> 兼容层只改属性不影响渲染。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "PointCloudDot",
      "text": "PointCloudDot"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p><code>PointCloudDot</code> 在指定半径的圆盘内随机撒出一片小点，拼出“点云圆盘”。它属于 <code>PMobject</code> 家族：没有矢量填充，每个点按 <code>stroke_width</code> 渲染为小方块。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "inheritance",
      "chain": [
        "PointCloudDot",
        "Mobject1D",
        "PMobject",
        "Mobject",
        "object"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<pre><code class=\"language-python\">PointCloudDot(\n    center: Point3DLike = ORIGIN,\n    radius: float = 2.0,\n    stroke_width: int = 2,\n    density: int = 10,\n    color: ManimColor = PURE_YELLOW,\n    **kwargs,\n)\n</code></pre>"
    },
    {
      "type": "params",
      "rows": [
        {
          "name": "<code>center</code>",
          "type": "Point3DLike",
          "default": "ORIGIN",
          "desc": "圆盘中心"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>radius</code>",
          "type": "float",
          "default": "2.0",
          "desc": "圆盘半径"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>stroke_width</code>",
          "type": "int",
          "default": "2",
          "desc": "每个点的渲染尺寸"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>density</code>",
          "type": "int",
          "default": "10",
          "desc": "点密度，越大点越多（每单位约 density² 量级）"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>color</code>",
          "type": "ManimColor",
          "default": "PURE_YELLOW",
          "desc": "点云颜色"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "demo",
      "example": "ch02/point_cloud_demo",
      "scene": "PointCloudDemo",
      "caption": "<p>两片 <code>PointCloudDot</code>：<code>density=15</code> 的大云与 <code>density=25</code> 的小云；点的位置是随机生成的。</p>",
      "code": "from manim import *\n\n\nclass PointCloudDemo(Scene):\n    def construct(self):\n        cloud = PointCloudDot(radius=1.2, density=15, color=YELLOW)\n        small = PointCloudDot(radius=0.6, density=25, color=RED).shift(2.5 * RIGHT)\n        self.play(FadeIn(cloud), FadeIn(small))\n        self.play(cloud.animate.scale(1.3))\n        self.wait(0.5)\n",
      "video": null
    },
    {
      "type": "notice",
      "level": "tip",
      "title": "提示",
      "html": "<p>点云的随机分布<strong>每次渲染都不同</strong>。需要可复现的结果时，用 CLI <code>--seed</code> 或 <code>Scene(random_seed=42)</code> 固定随机种子。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "PMobject",
      "text": "PMobject"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>点集基类：所有点成员共用一个 <code>points</code> 数组，无矢量填充（<code>stroke_width=4</code>）。四个点云基类的对比与继承链见下表。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "Mobject1D",
      "text": "Mobject1D"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>一维采样基类（<code>density=10</code>，<code>epsilon = 1/density</code>），用于沿曲线等距采样点。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "Mobject2D",
      "text": "Mobject2D"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>二维采样基类（<code>density=25</code>，<code>epsilon = 1/density</code>），用于在曲面上采样点。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "PGroup",
      "text": "PGroup"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p><code>PMobject</code> 的组合容器（成员非 <code>PMobject</code> 时抛 <code>ValueError</code>），用于把多片点云当一个整体变换；对应 <code>VMobject</code> 侧的 <code>VGroup</code>。</p>\n<p>点云家族四基类对比：</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "compare",
      "headers": [
        "类",
        "签名（默认参数）",
        "一句话用途"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "<code>PMobject</code>",
          "<code>(stroke_width=4)</code>",
          "点集基类：所有点成员一个 <code>points</code> 数组，无矢量填充"
        ],
        [
          "<code>Mobject1D</code>",
          "<code>(density=10)</code>",
          "一维采样基类（曲线），<code>epsilon = 1/density</code>"
        ],
        [
          "<code>Mobject2D</code>",
          "<code>(density=25)</code>",
          "二维采样基类（曲面），<code>epsilon = 1/density</code>"
        ],
        [
          "<code>PGroup</code>",
          "<code>(*pmobs)</code>",
          "<code>PMobject</code> 的组合容器；成员非 PMobject 时抛 <code>ValueError</code>"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>各成员的继承链：</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "inheritance",
      "chain": [
        "PMobject",
        "Mobject",
        "object"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "inheritance",
      "chain": [
        "Mobject1D",
        "PMobject",
        "Mobject",
        "object"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "inheritance",
      "chain": [
        "Mobject2D",
        "PMobject",
        "Mobject",
        "object"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "inheritance",
      "chain": [
        "PGroup",
        "PMobject",
        "Mobject",
        "object"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>日常使用中，只有 <code>PointCloudDot</code>（现成可看的点云）和 <code>Point</code> 需要直接构造；<code>PMobject</code> / <code>Mobject1D</code> / <code>Mobject2D</code> 更多是继承与扩展的基类，<code>PGroup</code> 用于把多片点云当一个整体变换。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "notice",
      "level": "warning",
      "title": "常见错误",
      "html": "<p>不要把 <code>PMobject</code> 家族的成员塞进 <code>VGroup</code>——<code>VGroup</code> 只收 <code>VMobject</code>，应改用 <code>PGroup</code>；反过来 <code>Dot</code> 是 <code>Circle</code> 子类，属于 <code>VMobject</code>，不要塞进 <code>PGroup</code>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "自测",
      "text": "自测"
    },
    {
      "type": "exercise",
      "questionHtml": "<p>下面两行代码各画出了什么？<code>Dot(LEFT * 2)</code> 与 <code>Dot(color=RED)</code> 的参数分别落在了哪个形参上？</p>",
      "answerHtml": "<p><code>Dot(LEFT * 2)</code> 把位置参数 <code>point</code> 设为 <code>LEFT * 2</code>，画出一个位于左侧 2 个单位的白色（默认色）圆点；<code>Dot(color=RED)</code> 用关键字传入 <code>color</code>，画出一个位于原点的红色圆点。若误写 <code>Dot(RED)</code>，<code>RED</code> 会被当成 <code>point</code> 而报错。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "exercise",
      "questionHtml": "<p>想让画面上有一个“带字母标签的圆点”，但机器没有安装 LaTeX，应该怎样构造 <code>LabeledDot</code>？如果还需要第二片点云与它一起整体移动，又该用什么容器组合？</p>",
      "answerHtml": "<p>标签用 pango 文本实例传入：<code>LabeledDot(Text(\"A\"))</code>，避免字符串触发的 <code>MathTex</code> 渲染。第二片点云用 <code>PointCloudDot</code> 构造；二者类型不同（<code>LabeledDot</code> 是 <code>VMobject</code>，点云是 <code>PMobject</code>），不能用 <code>VGroup</code> 也不能用 <code>PGroup</code> 混装，请用不校验类型的 <code>Group</code> 组合后再整体 <code>shift</code> / <code>scale</code>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "下一步",
      "text": "下一步"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>到这里，二维图形的基础工具已经齐全。下一节进入“线与箭头”，看看 <code>Line</code>、<code>Arrow</code> 和带端点的曲线。</p>"
    }
  ]
}